WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:03,150
Are you really going to pledge yourself to me just to save your life?

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,110
Mom, what are you talking about?

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:07,510
Lu Lin is just my friend

4
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:09,310
Tomorrow is a party to celebrate her recovery

5
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:12,110
Can you please stop messing around here?

6
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,910
If you hadn't answered my call

7
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,070
I can find it here

8
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:16,790
Why are you saying he's not your boyfriend?

9
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,190
Why do you do it next to her when she's not your boyfriend?

10
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,350
Don't try to lie to your mother

11
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:21,790
Your mother's eyes are poisonous

12
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:22,870
It's been like this since childhood

13
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:24,590
She always does her own thing stubbornly

14
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:27,430
Can't understand the form, selfish, unable to communicate

15
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,230
This is one of the reasons why she doesn't care

16
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:31,230
And I also told Song Jingyi about this

17
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:34,740
Sorry, my mother may have some misunderstanding.

18
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,060
Interrupting your party

19
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,260
I'll take her away first

20
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:40,060
You guys play slowly. What do you mean by following me?

21
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,260
Don't embarrass your mother

22
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,580
If it weren't for me, you would have grown so big

23
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,580
Do you know how hard it is for my dragster to find a partner?

24
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,980
Why, now that you have reached a high level, you know better than to embarrass your mother.

25
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,500
Come with me. I'll explain it to you when I get back.

26
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,420
If I don’t leave, why should I leave?

27
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:51,740
They didn't even drive me away with their little chess.

28
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:52,940
Why do you drive me away?

29
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,140
Right, Xiaoqi

30
00:00:54,740 --> 00:01:01,570
Why is she looking at me like that?

31
00:01:01,690 --> 00:01:04,250
I've been so harsh to her since childhood. If she really holds a grudge

32
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:05,650
What will you do if you don’t support me when I get old?

33
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:07,770
No, we can't continue to make trouble.

34
00:01:08,890 --> 00:01:11,100
I need to go to the restroom, right?

35
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,260
I'll go to the big size and leave

36
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,420
This place is in the wilderness

37
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:17,070
I really can't hold it in anymore, go now

38
00:01:17,190 --> 00:01:21,020
Miko, stop standing there

39
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,260
Come sit and wait for a while

40
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,020
Auntie should be back soon

41
00:01:24,340 --> 00:01:29,530
Keke, actually I have one more thing

42
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:30,610
want to apologize to you
